      "hadithIndex": 2491,
      "bookHadithIndex": 57,
      "text": "It was narrated from Hudhaifah bin Yaman that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:“Whoever sells a house and does not use the money for something similar, will not to be blessed therein.' ”",
